      <description>&lt;h2&gt;OpenRamble 0.3.10&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;## Finishing touches&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After a successful first dictation, onboarding now says where the app&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;lives — in the menu bar at the top of the screen — so the closing window&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;never reads as a vanished app. The try-out skip is a quiet button instead&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;of a link, and window activation uses the current macOS API throughout.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
